OL,3,ABirth of ospreys chicks on Anglesey is
OL,4,Aa first, experts say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe adult ospreys responsible for these
OL,7,Fchicks are one of about 300 breeding
OL,8,Fpairs in the UK, with about 20 in
OL,9,FWales.
